The '''Argofay Threebrothers''' are a group of three [[NPC]]s located in the {{Zone|Wyld Woods}}. Each of them appears in one of the three trees there and provides dialogue. After speaking to all three, each of them will offer to sell the player a {{Item|Wyld Sword}}.

